  "prefLabel": "Agr 1104.02 Percentages",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1104.02 Percentages. The term of \"percentage\" by symbol or word, when used on a fertilizer label shall represent only the amount of individual plant nutrients in relation to the total product by weight.\n\nSource. #10464, eff 11-26-13, EXPIRED: 11-26-23\n\nNew. #13947, eff 4-30-24, EXPIRED: 10-27-24\n\nNew. #14128, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
